  /* 12:1 left no room for tick labels; the strip is small but it is a plot. */
  /*
   * The strip is a receipt, so it stays short — but not so short that it cannot
   * be READ. 16:1 was an overcorrection: with the 12/32 px axis margins it left
   * 52 px of plotting area, which is too little to tell a bounded wobble from a
   * slow climb, and that distinction is the only thing the panel is for. 9:1 is
