   */
  .xpl-dyn__panel [data-energy] {
    aspect-ratio: 20 / 3;
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: auto;
  }
  /*
   * Axis titles exactly as census sets them: the y-title absolutely positioned
   * and rotated over the canvas's own left margin, both at --step-0.
   *
   * They were at --step--2 here — two steps below census — while the tick labels
   * silently fell back to the canvas default. So the whole axis furniture was
   * smaller than the diagram it was labelling, on a plot that carries the page's
   * central claim.
